      "cooked": "<p>Apologies for the horrible lack of knowledge and long response times here but I am away from both a regular internet connection and my copy of Sentinels!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I played a game last night and actually read the cards as they were played, rather than assuming that I knew what they said. Ambuscade's only Ongoing card reads something along the lines of</p><p>\"Increase Ambuscade's damage by 1.</p><p>When a Device is destroyed Ambuscade deals each Target 2 damage.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While the card seems straight forward enough I have to question if the word \"Hero\" is meant to be before \"Target\", it seems really counter productive&nbsp;for him to destroy his own devices.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Any one care to comment on their experiences/speculate wildly?</p>",
